:: Childbirth widget [widget]

/* <<newchild gender mother>>: a baby of mother (setup.humans.newBorn) in $newChild, added to the parents' family.
   Deletes mother.pregnancy; once every child is born the caller clears the rest with setup.humans.endPregnancy
   (it is not done here because twins read the same pregnancy_father). Doesn't touch $tmpGirl or $tmpGuy. */
<<widget newchild>>
	<<set _ncMother = $args[1]>>
	<<set _ncFather = _ncMother.pregnancy_father ? setup.getNpcById(_ncMother.pregnancy_father) : null>>
	<<set $newChild = setup.humans.newBorn({ gender: $args[0], mother: _ncMother, father: _ncFather, now: $gameDate })>>
	<<run setup.humans.linkFamily($newChild, _ncMother, _ncFather)>>
	<<run delete _ncMother.pregnancy>>
<</widget>>
